WEBVTT

00:00:11.668 --> 00:00:13.419
Who wants to go first?

00:00:13.461 --> 00:00:15.463
Okay, here's the thing though. Uh, yeah.

00:00:15.505 --> 00:00:17.674
-I mean, it's-it's... -Tiny Dog.

00:00:17.716 --> 00:00:19.425
Can I call you "Tiny Dog"?

00:00:19.467 --> 00:00:20.426
It fits you.

00:00:20.468 --> 00:00:22.595
Let's admit that. I mean, look,

00:00:22.637 --> 00:00:25.431
between you and the fat dog, I like you the best.

00:00:25.473 --> 00:00:26.432
Oh, thank you.

00:00:26.474 --> 00:00:28.727
Tiny Dog's gonna go first. [gasps]

00:00:28.768 --> 00:00:30.354
Everybody, TD's going first!

00:00:30.395 --> 00:00:31.437
No, no, no, no, no, no!

00:00:31.479 --> 00:00:33.273
Tiny Dog does not want to go first!

00:00:33.315 --> 00:00:35.441
[chanting] Snake bite! Take the fat dog!  [screams]

00:00:35.483 --> 00:00:37.861
-No, no, no, no, no, no. Stop! -Snake bite! Snake bite!

00:00:37.903 --> 00:00:39.487
Snake bite! Snake bite!

00:00:39.529 --> 00:00:41.198
Snake bite! Snake bite! [hissing]

00:00:41.240 --> 00:00:42.490
-Snake bite! Snake bite! -Oh, no, no, no!

00:00:42.532 --> 00:00:45.451
Snake bite! Snake bite! NITRO: Stop!

00:00:45.493 --> 00:00:49.455
initiating a couple domestics? What are you doing

00:00:49.497 --> 00:00:50.665
Domestics?

00:00:50.707 --> 00:00:52.584
those two in the alley. Yeah. We just jumped

00:00:52.625 --> 00:00:54.294
Slashed off their collars.

00:00:54.336 --> 00:00:55.461
SNOWBALL: No, no, no. That-that's not true.

00:00:55.503 --> 00:00:57.463
You said you burned your collars.

00:00:57.505 --> 00:01:00.592
"had them stolen by cats." Well, "burned," "lost,"

00:01:00.633 --> 00:01:03.178
It's all just words, really, isn't it?

00:01:03.220 --> 00:01:05.513
You don't deserve to be marked by the viper.

00:01:05.555 --> 00:01:07.473
-We'll just show ourselves out. -Oh, no.

00:01:07.515 --> 00:01:10.852
You deserve to be eaten by the viper!

00:01:10.894 --> 00:01:13.021
Get those leash lovers!

00:01:13.063 --> 00:01:14.564
[barking, clamoring]

00:01:14.606 --> 00:01:15.565
[Duke and Max scream]

00:01:15.607 --> 00:01:17.567
[gasps]

00:01:17.609 --> 00:01:18.944
[hissing]

00:01:18.985 --> 00:01:20.445
Hold on.

00:01:23.531 --> 00:01:24.490
[hissing]

00:01:24.532 --> 00:01:26.201
[screeching, barking]

00:01:27.911 --> 00:01:29.454
Go get 'em, Duke!

00:01:29.495 --> 00:01:30.496
Whoa.

00:01:30.538 --> 00:01:33.750
[screaming]

00:01:33.792 --> 00:01:35.543
[grunts]

00:01:38.713 --> 00:01:40.840
[gasps]

00:01:40.882 --> 00:01:41.967
[snarling]

00:01:42.008 --> 00:01:44.552
[gasps]

00:01:44.594 --> 00:01:46.846
[hissing]

00:01:53.686 --> 00:01:55.063
[gasping]

00:01:55.105 --> 00:01:56.522
[sniffing]

00:01:56.564 --> 00:01:58.233
[hissing]

00:01:59.318 --> 00:02:00.693
[gasping]

00:02:02.946 --> 00:02:04.489
[gasping]

00:02:06.450 --> 00:02:09.911
that was an accident. Uh, fellas,

00:02:09.953 --> 00:02:12.038
You squished the sacred viper!

00:02:12.080 --> 00:02:13.539
[sobs]

00:02:13.581 --> 00:02:15.000
He's a flapjack!

00:02:15.041 --> 00:02:17.419
[sobbing] Oh, Viper!

00:02:17.461 --> 00:02:19.545
Viper, you in a better place!

00:02:19.587 --> 00:02:20.713
You and Ricky!

00:02:20.755 --> 00:02:22.924
[sobbing continues] [taps plays faintly]

00:02:22.966 --> 00:02:24.592
[whimpering, sniffling]

00:02:24.634 --> 00:02:27.679
You ain't never did nothing to nobody!

00:02:27.720 --> 00:02:29.722
Well, you bit a lot of people, Viper.

00:02:29.764 --> 00:02:31.724
So, technically, you might actually deserve this.

00:02:31.766 --> 00:02:34.353
This might be something that was long overdue.

00:02:34.394 --> 00:02:36.604
But it shouldn't have came like this!

00:02:36.646 --> 00:02:38.564
Not on my watch!

00:02:38.606 --> 00:02:40.108
Get 'em!

00:02:40.150 --> 00:02:42.068
[barking, clamoring]

00:02:42.110 --> 00:02:43.569
Oh, no!

00:02:43.611 --> 00:02:44.737
Come on!

00:02:44.779 --> 00:02:47.240
[screams, grunts]

00:02:53.788 --> 00:02:56.291
video game sound effects] [Max screams,

00:03:00.003 --> 00:03:02.297
[grunts]

00:03:02.339 --> 00:03:04.257
[screams] Wait up, Duke!

00:03:04.299 --> 00:03:06.592
[Snowball yelling]

00:03:06.634 --> 00:03:08.178
[snorting]

00:03:08.220 --> 00:03:09.554
We're sorry!

00:03:09.595 --> 00:03:10.972
Can this be over now?

00:03:11.014 --> 00:03:12.224
[grunts]

00:03:12.265 --> 00:03:13.350
We've got a problem.

00:03:13.392 --> 00:03:14.726
We have so many problems.

00:03:14.767 --> 00:03:17.270
Which one do you mean at this moment?

00:03:22.234 --> 00:03:23.985
Stop running, dummies! SNOWBALL:

00:03:24.027 --> 00:03:25.362
Stop it right now!

00:03:25.404 --> 00:03:26.612
Hold your breath!

00:03:26.654 --> 00:03:28.907
Hold my breath? [screams]

00:03:28.948 --> 00:03:30.909
[both screaming]

00:03:33.286 --> 00:03:35.288
[screams]

00:03:35.330 --> 00:03:37.790
[both gasping]

00:03:37.832 --> 00:03:41.586
This is my least favorite part of this whole thing so far!

00:03:42.670 --> 00:03:44.630
♪ ♪

00:03:54.974 --> 00:03:56.435
[grunts]

00:03:56.476 --> 00:03:58.562
[groans] Friends!

00:03:58.603 --> 00:04:01.647
I am afraid that I have some terrible news.

00:04:01.689 --> 00:04:03.691
The squirrels are gonna take over the world!

00:04:03.733 --> 00:04:05.151
I knew it!

00:04:05.193 --> 00:04:07.987
I always said, squirrels are little shifty little guys.

00:04:08.029 --> 00:04:10.282
the squirrel thing right now. No. We're not doing

00:04:10.323 --> 00:04:12.284
That's not... No. [sighs]

00:04:12.325 --> 00:04:14.160
Max is missing!

00:04:14.202 --> 00:04:15.870
He's out there somewhere.

00:04:15.912 --> 00:04:17.830
Lost. Scared.

00:04:17.872 --> 00:04:19.499
So, so handsome.

00:04:19.541 --> 00:04:21.876
We have got to find him and bring him home!

00:04:21.918 --> 00:04:25.046
But the outside world is loud and scary.

00:04:25.088 --> 00:04:26.672
[screams] Is that a hawk?!

00:04:26.714 --> 00:04:28.674
This is my friend, Tiberius. GIDGET:

00:04:28.716 --> 00:04:30.135
He's going to help us.

00:04:30.176 --> 00:04:31.677
He's not going to eat us.

00:04:31.719 --> 00:04:33.679
We've already been over it. BUDDY: Come on, Gidget.

00:04:33.721 --> 00:04:35.265
We go out there without a leash,

00:04:35.307 --> 00:04:36.682
we'll get caught by a net.

00:04:36.724 --> 00:04:37.934
Or something worse.

00:04:37.976 --> 00:04:39.769
Yeah, like a hawk!

00:04:39.811 --> 00:04:41.062
We're wasting time!

00:04:41.104 --> 00:04:42.688
Max needs us.

00:04:42.730 --> 00:04:45.358
Come on, girl, Max doesn't even know you're alive.

00:04:45.400 --> 00:04:46.692
Well, I don't care.

00:04:46.734 --> 00:04:47.693
I love him.

00:04:47.735 --> 00:04:49.695
with all of my heart. I love him

00:04:49.737 --> 00:04:52.824
And I'm gonna go look for Max, no matter who's with me.

00:04:52.865 --> 00:04:55.660
So, who's with me?

00:04:58.497 --> 00:05:00.748
[door opens, closes]

00:05:00.790 --> 00:05:02.167
All right, fine.

00:05:02.208 --> 00:05:03.502
Fine.

00:05:03.543 --> 00:05:06.045
Oh, come on, guys.

00:05:06.087 --> 00:05:07.839
I can't believe you.

00:05:07.880 --> 00:05:10.509
caught in the curtains, When I got my claws

00:05:10.550 --> 00:05:12.718
who pulled me down?

00:05:12.760 --> 00:05:14.095
Max did.

00:05:14.137 --> 00:05:16.264
Buddy, Mel,

00:05:16.306 --> 00:05:17.723
when you were fixed,

00:05:17.765 --> 00:05:19.434
who taught you to sit the comfortable way?

00:05:19.476 --> 00:05:21.436
-Max did. -Max did!

00:05:21.478 --> 00:05:23.438
[panting] Max did. He did it!

00:05:23.480 --> 00:05:26.441
And when that random cat tried to eat Sweetpea,

00:05:26.483 --> 00:05:28.401
who saved him?

00:05:28.443 --> 00:05:29.569
It wasn't a random cat.

00:05:29.611 --> 00:05:30.862
It was you. [Sweetpea chirps]

00:05:30.903 --> 00:05:33.281
The identity of the random cat is not the point.

00:05:33.323 --> 00:05:35.741
We're talking about who saved him.

00:05:35.783 --> 00:05:37.743
-We got to save him! -Max did!

00:05:37.785 --> 00:05:39.745
-We got to go save Max! -Yeah!

00:05:39.787 --> 00:05:40.997
[laughing]

00:05:41.039 --> 00:05:43.749
Yeah! Let's go save Max!

00:05:43.791 --> 00:05:45.751
Uh, which one is Max again?

00:05:45.793 --> 00:05:46.711
Oh!

00:05:47.753 --> 00:05:49.755
-Tiberius. -Um...

00:05:49.797 --> 00:05:51.049
No! [chuckles nervously]

00:05:51.090 --> 00:05:52.467
Bad, bad bird!

00:05:52.509 --> 00:05:55.887
[chuckles] Nice little guy.

00:05:55.928 --> 00:05:57.597
Nice little guy.

00:05:57.639 --> 00:05:58.890
I like this bird.

00:05:58.931 --> 00:06:00.766
-Crazy bird. -Um...

00:06:00.808 --> 00:06:02.101
[chuckles]

00:06:02.143 --> 00:06:04.396
[both gasping, grunting]

00:06:12.945 --> 00:06:16.824
[both screaming]

00:06:24.832 --> 00:06:26.543
[rumbling]

00:06:26.585 --> 00:06:27.751
[both screaming]

00:06:31.590 --> 00:06:32.798
[gasping]

00:06:32.840 --> 00:06:33.799
Come on!

00:06:33.841 --> 00:06:35.594
We got to get to shore!

00:06:35.635 --> 00:06:37.220
I only know the doggy paddle!

00:06:37.262 --> 00:06:40.181
And I don't know it well!

00:06:40.223 --> 00:06:41.891
Swim, Tiny Dog! Swim!

00:06:41.933 --> 00:06:43.643
[both gasping]

00:06:51.859 --> 00:06:53.111
Duke!

00:06:56.406 --> 00:06:58.617
Help! [coughing]

00:07:03.246 --> 00:07:05.206
Max, grab the ring!

00:07:05.248 --> 00:07:07.208
I-I can't!

00:07:07.250 --> 00:07:08.501
Keep it up, Max!

00:07:08.543 --> 00:07:10.503
You're doing... Well, you know,

00:07:10.545 --> 00:07:12.672
you're not doing great, but you're not drowning,

00:07:12.714 --> 00:07:13.839
and that's something!

00:07:13.881 --> 00:07:16.301
[gasping]

00:07:16.342 --> 00:07:19.220
[grunting]

00:07:19.262 --> 00:07:21.180
[coughing]

00:07:21.222 --> 00:07:22.848
You're almost there!

00:07:22.890 --> 00:07:23.475
[gasps]

00:07:23.516 --> 00:07:26.018
[gasps, grunting]

00:07:32.317 --> 00:07:34.986
[groans]

00:07:35.027 --> 00:07:36.321
[sighs]

00:07:36.362 --> 00:07:37.989
Thanks, Duke.

00:07:38.030 --> 00:07:39.823
No problem.

00:07:39.865 --> 00:07:42.327
Finally, I'm going home.

00:07:42.368 --> 00:07:43.827
Uh...

00:07:43.869 --> 00:07:46.247
Isn't home that way?

00:07:46.289 --> 00:07:47.457
[groans] Ah!

00:07:47.499 --> 00:07:48.874
Seriously?

00:07:48.916 --> 00:07:51.586
[gasps] [ferry horn blows]

00:07:52.671 --> 00:07:54.631
[animals screaming, groaning] Whee!

00:07:56.007 --> 00:07:59.344
[grunting]

00:07:59.385 --> 00:08:00.679
They're going to Brooklyn.

00:08:00.720 --> 00:08:03.473
They say everyone's going to Brooklyn these days.

00:08:03.515 --> 00:08:05.016
It's making a real comeback.

00:08:05.057 --> 00:08:07.686
hipster real estate trends. I'm not talking about

00:08:07.727 --> 00:08:09.895
about vengeance, Tattoo. I'm talking

00:08:09.937 --> 00:08:12.106
Death is coming to Brooklyn,

00:08:12.148 --> 00:08:16.611
and it's got buck teeth and a cotton tail!

